			[ 'What temperature should holiday let bedding be washed at?', 'Wash sheets, duvet covers, pillowcases and towels at 60°C where the care label allows. It gives a hygienic reset between guests and helps keep white linen bright.' ],
			[ 'Is linen hire worth it for a holiday let?', 'Linen hire saves time and removes the need for laundry equipment and storage, which suits owners with several properties. Owning your own linen gives more control over quality and is more flexible around last-minute bookings.' ],
